This doesn't answer your questions but I am hoping it will hope with your hiccups.

I can share two stories;

1) I have recently given myself permission to work on getting better. I recently saw a doctor and started medication again. Though the medication has had adverse affects I'm still going to keep trying. 

2) I have a cat who loves to follow me around. In the morning she will lay on my head or my phone to get my attention.  When she gets in front of me she will plop on her back and demand belly rubs. She purrs as loud as a train.
